      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_97e7dc52_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong></strong>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page.   "
